stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "Quiz (test)" as Quiz {
        [*] --> DRAFT
        DRAFT --> PUBLISHED: publish (needs questions, cannot edit after)
        PUBLISHED --> CLOSED: close
        CLOSED --> [*]
    }

    state "Attempt (one sitting)" as Attempt {
        [*] --> IN_PROGRESS: start (allowance checked, questions drawn)
        IN_PROGRESS --> SUBMITTED: student submits, scored on the server
        IN_PROGRESS --> EXPIRED: AttemptExpiryJob after the deadline
        IN_PROGRESS --> TERMINATED: violations reach max_violations
        SUBMITTED --> [*]
        EXPIRED --> [*]
        TERMINATED --> [*]
    }

    Quiz --> Attempt: only while PUBLISHED
    note right of Attempt
        A trainer can give one student another attempt
        (+1 attempt) after an expired or terminated sitting.
    end note
